DESCRIPTION:[] (https://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/files/13505106/p
 review?hidden=1)\n\n------------------------------\nCheckpoint: Introduce 
 Yourself\n------------------------------\n\nThis is not a quiz\, but we ar
 e using the quiz format to help us accomplish the purpose of this Checkpoi
 nt assignment. In this first checkpoint of the semester\, we’ll spend a 
 few minutes getting to know each other. I want to understand why you enrol
 led in REL C 333 and what you expect to get out of this course. I also wan
 t to help you determine how you can prepare to be successful\, including s
 ome realistic goals for completing the course.\n\nYour responses don’t n
 eed to be lengthy\, but please be specific and thorough because I would si
 ncerely like to know you as a student. This will help me remember you and 
 interact more successfully throughout the semester.\n\nYou will submit you
 r answers by the indicated deadline and then receive some feedback from yo
 ur instructor within a few days. Check back to read the response from your
  Instructor team\, and then make another comment to follow up with any que
 stions or observations by the following week. Note: Click on your Account 
 photo on the left blue sidebar and\, under the Notifications tab\, make su
 re you have selected to receive notifications for Submission Comments. If 
 you added the class on or after the first due date of the semester\, pleas
 e mention so in your response so that you will not be marked late for your
  initial submission.
