BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Patterns of Revelation Essay [REL C 333-033]
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTSTAMP:20260910T140700Z
UID:event-assignment-1441135
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:[] (https://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/files/13505106/p
 review?hidden=1)\n\nEstimated time: 30 minutes\n\nFor this assignment\, yo
 u will write an essay on “Patterns of Revelation.” It is expected that
  you will synthesize the information you learned in the lesson “[Why Do 
 We Need Prophets?] (https://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/pages/lesson
 -1-why-do-we-need-prophets)\,” Elder Christofferson’s talk on the doct
 rine of Christ\, and chapter 1 of the Teachings of the Living Prophets man
 ual.\n\nYou will write your essay as three separate short-answer questions
 \, with each paragraph consisting of 4–6 sentences that thoughtfully add
 ress the given prompts. Do not use quotes from the readings\; show you und
 erstand them by summarizing in your own words.\n\nParagraph 1: What did yo
 u learn about the reasons that God uses prophets? Refer to several example
 s from the list of “doctrinal mastery” scriptures and from Hugh B. Bro
 wn’s conversation with the judge in the Living Prophets chapter. How did
  these enhance your understanding of living prophets?\n\nParagraph 2: In y
 our own words\, summarize the subject matter Elder Christofferson defined 
 as our core doctrine in his talk\, "The Doctrine of Christ." Then identify
  how revelation comes to the church using three principles he taught. \n
 \nParagraph 3: What did you find significant about these patterns of revel
 ation to the Church? What ideas did you have as you read this unit that ca
 n help you improve access to personal revelation?\n\nSubmission instructio
 ns: Your essay should be submitted as a Word Document or PDF: Double space
 d\, in 12-point Times New Roman font\, with one-inch margins. Write your n
 ame and “Patterns of Revelation Essay” at the top of the page. (If you
  added the class on or after the due date of this assignment\, please stat
 e such as a submission comment so that adjustments to late penalty can be 
 made.)\n\nRubric: You will earn up to 9 points for fulfilling the content 
 requirements of each paragraph and 1 point for using proper formatting and
  mechanics.\n\nModule Item Completion (built in browser\, hidden in app)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://byu.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _35044&month=09&year=2026#assignment_1441135
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instruct
 ure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8409020
 /dp_app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instructure-uploads.s3.a
 mazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8073295/canvas-byuonlin
 e-app.css"><p><img src="https://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/files/13
 505106/preview?hidden=1" alt="" width="2389" height="554" data-decorative=
 "true" data-api-endpoint="https://byu.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/35044
 /files/13505106" data-api-returntype="File" loading="lazy"></p>\n<p><span 
 style="font-size: 10pt\;"><em>Estimated time: 30 minutes</em></span></p>\n
 <p>For this assignment\, you will write an essay on “Patterns of Revelat
 ion.” It is expected that you will synthesize the information you learne
 d in the lesson “<a title="Lesson 1: Why Do We Need Prophets?" href="htt
 ps://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/pages/lesson-1-why-do-we-need-proph
 ets" data-api-endpoint="https://byu.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/35044/p
 ages/lesson-1-why-do-we-need-prophets" data-api-returntype="Page">Why Do W
 e Need Prophets?</a>\,” Elder Christofferson’s talk on the doctrine of
  Christ\, and chapter 1 of the <em>Teachings of the Living Prophets</em> m
 anual.</p>\n<p>You will write your essay as three separate short-answer qu
 estions\, with each paragraph consisting of <span style="color: #993300\;"
 ><strong>4–6 sentences</strong></span> that thoughtfully address the giv
 en prompts. Do not use quotes from the readings\; show you understand them
  by summarizing in your own words.</p>\n<p style="padding-left: 40px\;"><s
 trong>Paragraph 1:</strong> What did you learn about the <em>reasons</em> 
 that God uses prophets? Refer to several examples from the list of “doct
 rinal mastery” scriptures and from Hugh B. Brown’s conversation with t
 he judge in the <em>Living Prophets</em> chapter. How did these enhance yo
 ur understanding of living prophets?</p>\n<p style="padding-left: 40px\;">
 <strong>Paragraph 2:</strong> In your own words\, summarize the subject ma
 tter Elder Christofferson defined as our <em>core doctrine</em> in his tal
 k\, "The Doctrine of Christ." Then identify <em>how</em> revelation comes 
 to the church using three principles he taught.&nbsp\;</p>\n<p style="padd
 ing-left: 40px\;"><strong>Paragraph 3:</strong> What did you find signific
 ant about these patterns of revelation to the Church? <span>What ideas did
  you have as you read this unit that can help you improve access to <em>pe
 rsonal</em> revelation? </span></p>\n<p><strong>Submission instructions:</
 strong> Your essay should be submitted as a Word Document or PDF: Double s
 paced\, in 12-point Times New Roman font\, with one-inch margins. Write yo
 ur name and “Patterns of Revelation Essay” at the top of the page. (If
  you added the class on or after the due date of this assignment\, please 
 state such as a submission comment so that adjustments to late penalty can
  be made.)</p>\n<p><strong>Rubric:</strong> You will earn up to 9 points f
 or fulfilling the content requirements of each paragraph and 1 point for u
 sing proper formatting and mechanics.</p>\n<p class="kl_module_progress_co
 mpletion" style="display: none\;">Module Item Completion (built in browser
 \, hidden in app)</p><script src="https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws
 .com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8409019/dp_app.js"></script>
END:VEVENT
