 /files/13505106" data-api-returntype="File" loading="lazy"></p>\n<p><span 
 style="font-size: 10pt\;"><em>Estimated time: 40 minutes</em></span></p>\n
 <p><strong>Watch this video about discussion board guidelines for the seme
 ster:</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span style="font-size: 8pt\;"><a id="5262
 342" class="instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_disabled"
  href="https://byu.instructure.com/courses/35044/files/13505320?wrap=1" ta
